SessionSifu 3.2.0

The GNOME Shell session engine is derived from Another Window Session Manager:
  https://github.com/nlpsuge/gnome-shell-extension-another-window-session-manager
  audited upstream revision: cf23fef152ce90692fc1df984f6fd945725334be

Original project copyright remains with nlpsuge and its contributors.
Modifications for SessionSifu include GNOME Shell 50 targeting, a distinct
UUID/configuration namespace, safer defaults, a session-control D-Bus interface,
a standalone GTK/libadwaita manager, login integration, rolling automatic
history, recent-document restoration, an unprivileged user-local updater,
a verified GitHub update channel and Debian packaging.

Both the upstream project and this derivative are licensed under GNU GPL v3.

Smart Auto Move NG was evaluated as a possible foundation at revision
b4a55a7b15439eb8f6bd94d7d559154143c3b20f. No Smart Auto Move NG source code is
included in SessionSifu 3.2.0.

